       "_key": "ia3w0mv7208l",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "In the heart of Egypt, where history whispers from the sands and the Red Sea mirrors the sun’s golden hues, Al Quseir stands as a gateway to exploration—a place where ancient marvels and natural wonders blend seamlessly. Our meticulously curated 11-day journey invites you to immerse yourself in Egypt’s profound history, from the majestic "
