       "text": "light and sound"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000c",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " spectacle, narrating tales as old as time. The journey through Cairo’s heart continues with a visit to the Mohamed Ali Mosque, an architectural masterpiece, followed by a treasure hunt through the winding alleys of "
      },
